OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for #24m drone-busting
OL,4,Amissile factory lodged
OL,5,
OL,6,FMissiles used to shoot down military
OL,7,Fdrones could be built and tested on a
OL,8,Fformer airbase in rural Norfolk.
OL,10,FCambridge Aerospace, which was founded
OL,11,Ftwo years ago and is already said to be
OL,12,Fworth $3.4bn (#2.51bn), has a contract
OL,13,Fto supply the Ministry of Defence (MoD)
OL,14,Fwith "Skyhammer" missiles.
OL,16,FIt wants to expand its operation at
OL,17,FScottow, the site of the old RAF
OL,18,FColtishall base, which closed in 2006.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
