OL,4,Amissile factory lodged
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm said its proposals would
OL,7,Finvolve around #24m of investment and
OL,8,Fit has applied to North Norfolk
OL,9,FDistrict Council (NNDC) for planning
OL,10,Fpermission.
